# Correlated Attack Chain Detection
# Combines multiple event types to detect a multi-stage attack
# Maps to: T1046 -> T1087 -> T1110 -> T1078

index=main host=dc (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625) src_ip="192.168.57.10"
| eval attack_phase=case(
    EventCode=4625, "Phase 1: Brute Force Attempts",
    EventCode=4624, "Phase 2: Successful Authentication",
    1=1, "Other"
)
| where attack_phase!="Other"
| stats count by attack_phase, src_ip
| sort -count

# Description:
# This correlation query ties authentication events from the attacker IP
# into a coherent attack timeline.
#
# Attack phases detected:
# Phase 1: Brute Force / Password Spray (EventCode 4625)
# Phase 2: Successful Authentication (EventCode 4624)
#
# Alert recommendation:
# - Trigger when Phases 1 AND 2 occur within 30 minutes from same src_ip
